# U41: the search filter and the custom mod blocks. Typing a search no label matches
# (searchMatch / matchOrPattern) hides every option, so only "Custom Modifiers" (its add button
# ignores the search) stays, laid out at the top of column 1 at both resolutions. Then:
# * type a mod into the block's text (changeFunc per character: blockData.text, BuildModList,
#   rebuild), click outside (the unfocused edit draws the inactiveText: parseMod colours);
# * hover the enable check (the "Disabling this group will give you:" compare through the bridge),
#   click it (blockData.enabled = false);
# * "Add Mod Group" (UpdateCustomModsControls: a second block "Group 2"), edit its title;
# * delete the first block (table.remove, the blocks rebuilt).
#! u41-expect-config enabled="false" title="Default"
#! u41-expect-config title="Group 2X" enabled="true"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
move 400 91
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 1
press RETURN
frames 3
key-down CTRL
press 5
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 500 75
click LEFTBUTTON
type "zqzq"
frames 3
move 510 205
click LEFTBUTTON
type "+100 to maximum Life"
press RETURN
type "Nonsense line"
frames 3
move 500 290
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 673 154
frames 3
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot disabled
move 450 128
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 470 264
click LEFTBUTTON
press END
type "X"
frames 3
snapshot added
move 348 154
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot deleted
